<title>USA: Pizza Inn to buy back 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Pizza Inn to buy back 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pizza Inn Inc said on Wednesday its board approved the open market repurchase of an additional 500,000 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Pizza said that this continues a buy-back program carried out by the company since March 1995.</p>
<p>The company has bought 1.5 million shares, which would be retired, leaving 13 million shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>The buy-back purchases would continue to be funded by working capital.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
